  "description": "The MHT 8.6 Womens combines trail friendly geometry with cross-country speed for a fast and confidence inspiring ride. The frame is designed to give a reassuring level of stability as you navigate technical sections and Suntour’s Raidon air-sprung fork offers 120mm of highly tuneable travel to cope with whatever trails you chose.\n\nThe MHT 8.6 features the new Shimano Deore M4100 1x 10 drivetrain coupled with an 11-46T cassette giving plenty of range with precise shifts. The bike is built on 27.5 inch wheels which give fantastic rolling speed and smoothness and comes with Vittoria Barzo tyres which give fantastic grip both in dry loose conditions as well as on muddier, wetter days. Braking is taken care of with powerful Tektro HD-M286 hydraulic discs, with a shorter reach to the lever to suit smaller hands.\n\nWith a female specific saddle, handlebar widths and geometry, the MHT 8.6 should be a comfortable ride as well as a fast one.\n\nHighlights\n\nShimano Deore M4100 1x10 gearing with an 11-46T cassette giving a great range\n\nLight but strong hidden-weld alloy frame with trail geometry and dropper post routing.\n\nSuntour Raidon XC Air Fork with 120mm of travel\n\nTektro M286 hydraulic disc brakes for controlled and reliable stopping\n\nBoardman Tubeless ready wheelset with grippy Vittoria Barzo tyres\n\n*Some parts may be subject to substitutions of similar quality due to Covid-19 related supply chain issues",
